{"version":3,"term":{"cols":164,"rows":36},"timestamp":1790199386,"command":".scripts/demo-push.sh","env":{"SHELL":"/bin/zsh"}}
[1.0, "o", "\u001b[36m[demo]\u001b[0m workbench 99314ec5...  runs a mock CI: deploy / status / logs; may push to analysts\r\n\u001b[36m[demo]\u001b[0m agent     1321042b...  signed in as alice@example.com; runs only `wires call` and `wires inbox` (locked)\r\n"]
[0.003, "o", "     deploy  deploy a CI build: `deploy -- build <n>`  (analyst)\r\n     logs    logs a CI build: `logs -- build <n>`      (analyst)\r\n     status  status a CI build: `status -- build <n>`  (analyst)\r\n"]
[5.0, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m[demo] 1  the agent starts a build -- the service returns at once\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.513, "o", "\u001b[2m     $ wires call deploy -- build 41\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.1, "o", "     started build-41 for 1321042b\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[32m[ok]\u001b[0m   1: deploy returned in 1 s; build-41 runs on the workbench (8 s here, minutes in life)\r\n"]
[5.0, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m[demo] 2  the agent waits -- `wires inbox --wait`, a background command in Claude Code\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.512, "o", "\u001b[2m     $ wires inbox --wait --timeout 30s &\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.011, "o", "\u001b[32m[ok]\u001b[0m   2: waiting (pid 18062), no webhook URL\r\n"]
[5.0, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m[demo] 3  the build fails on the workbench; its job pushes to $WIRES_CALLER_NODE\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.556, "o", "\u001b[2m     $ # the job ran:  wires push --to \"$WIRES_CALLER_NODE\" --subject build-41 -- 'failed: …'\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.003, "o", "     queued     alice@example.com (1321042b)  27c66dd802eb80afd82978c64ed28daa\r\n"]
[0.007, "o", "     2026-09-23 21:36:59Z  from host 99314ec5 (verified)  build-41  failed: test_orders_total (1 of 214 tests). Logs: wires call logs -- build 41 --tail 50\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[32m[ok]\u001b[0m   3: inbox --wait woke with the push; the sender is the host key, verified\r\n"]
[5.0, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m[demo] 4  woken, the agent follows up -- the log, from the same host\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.514, "o", "\u001b[2m     $ wires call logs -- build 41 --tail 50\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.083, "o", "     thread 'orders::tests::test_orders_total' panicked at orders/total.rs:88:9:\r\n     assertion `left == right` failed: sum(total) over the fixture orders\r\n       left: 1275.41\r\n      right: 1234.50\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[32m[ok]\u001b[0m   4: test_orders_total: left 1275.41, right 1234.50\r\n"]
[5.0, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m[demo] 5  the workbench's own log holds the whole chain -- the agent reads its part\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.511, "o", "\u001b[2m     $ wires watch --once   # the agent's own calls, and the pushes to it\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.097, "o", "\u001b[32m[ok]\u001b[0m   5: ▶ deploy → ⇢ push → ▶ logs, in order, verified against the host's signed log\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[1m     21:36:51 deploy    ▶ 4571 alice@example.com (1321…) [analyst] deploy build 41\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[1m     21:36:59 -         ⇢ 27c6 → alice@example.com (1321…) [analyst] \"build-41\" fetched\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[1m     21:37:04 logs      ▶ f883 alice@example.com (1321…) [analyst] logs build 41 --tail 50\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[5.0, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m[demo] 6  a sleeping agent: nothing running -- the push waits on the workbench\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.511, "o", "\u001b[2m     $ wires call deploy -- build 42   # and then the agent stops; no inbox running\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[6.0, "o", "\u001b[32m[ok]\u001b[0m   6: build-42 failed while the agent slept; the push is queued on the workbench\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[2m     $ wires inbox   # the agent's next turn, whenever that is\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.056, "o", "     2026-09-23 21:37:22Z  from host 99314ec5 (verified)  build-42  failed: test_orders_total (1 of 214 tests). Logs: wires call logs -- build 42 --tail 50\r\n"]
[0.056, "o", "\u001b[32m[ok]\u001b[0m   6: fetched on the next `wires inbox` -- once\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[1m     21:37:25 -         ⇢ 1e4f → alice@example.com (1321…) [analyst] \"build-42\" fetched\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[5.0, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m[demo] SUMMARY\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.505, "o", "     callback  : build-41 result pushed host -> agent by key; inbox --wait woke 62 ms after the build finished\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "     follow-up : logs -- build 41 --tail 50 -> test_orders_total left 1275.41\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "     recorded  : ▶ deploy → ⇢ build-41 → ▶ logs in the host's signed log, naming alice@example.com\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "     asleep    : build-42 queued on the workbench, fetched by the next `wires inbox`\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "     exposed   : nothing on the agent -- no webhook URL; 61s wall clock\r\n"]
[0.022, "x", "0"]
